"                                you. They are masked in this form and handled\n"
"                                as a secret on every screen, but stored as\n"
"                                regular configuration data, not encrypted at\n"
"                                rest. For production, keep the database access\n"
"                                controlled or point a vault at the Advanced\n"
"                                credentials field."
